Registers plugins for ZIS found within the specified component.
This involves registering the plugins into the ZIS PARMLIB,
as well as making the software available to ZIS either by
adding its content to the ZIS APF authorized plugin LOADLIB,
or by adding a reference to the component's provided LOADLIBs
into the ZIS STC JCL via STEPLIB entries.


NOTE: this sub-command will be automatically executed by `zwe components install`,
      so usually you don't need to execute this manually.
